      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-09-13_WidnesExaminer_art0042" n="art0042">
        <head>TOGETHER WITH AN EXTRAORDINARY</head>
        <p>TOGETHER WITH AN EXTRAORDINARY</p>
        <p>SPECIAL PURCHASE OF LADIES' , SHIRTS AND BLOUSE 3</p>
